  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since we are now allowed up to 100 favorite slots, can we please be allowed to finally favorite our own avatars? Right now all you can do is favorite public avatars. I understand this was done so that people cant start accidently using someone else's private avatar, but surely there could be a way for the system to check whether you're the one that uploaded the avatar, and if so, allow you to favorite it.\nI, like many other content creators, have hundreds of avatars I've uploaded over the past few years. There is still no way to organize them, and the favorites system seems to be as close as we're getting, but you can only use it for public avatars.",
